{
  "$schema": "./node_modules/@stryker-mutator/core/schema/stryker-schema.json",
  "_comment": [
    "Mutation testing: changes the source in small ways and checks that a test",
    "notices. It answers the question coverage cannot \u2014 whether the tests actually",
    "assert anything, or merely execute the lines.",
    "",
    "Scoped to the pure logic on purpose. Mutating Electron-bound code would spend",
    "minutes producing mutants no unit test can reach, and a low score there would",
    "say nothing about test quality. These files are where a silent mistake is",
    "expensive: a filter that stops matching, geometry that misplaces a tile, a",
    "permission that resolves the wrong way.",
    "",
    "Thresholds are deliberately high because the surface is small and pure. If",
    "`break` starts failing, the honest reactions are to add the missing assertion",
    "or to delete code nothing depends on \u2014 not to lower the number."
  ],
  "packageManager": "pnpm",
  "_comment_ignorePatterns": [
    "Stryker copies the project into a sandbox before mutating, and the copy is what these exclude from.",
    "",
    "`dist/` is the electron-builder output, and it contains a packaged `.app` whose framework directory is a",
    "symlink Node's `copyFile` cannot follow — `ENOTSUP: operation not supported on socket`. So the whole run",
    "died during setup, before a single mutant, and reported a copy error rather than anything about tests.",
    "The rest are simply large and pointless to copy: nothing in them is mutated or read by a test."
  ],
  "ignorePatterns": ["dist", "out", "coverage", "reports", ".stryker-tmp", "node_modules/.cache"],
  "_comment_plugins": [
    "Declared explicitly because pnpm's symlinked layout defeats Stryker's default",
    "plugin glob: without this it reports that no checker plugins were loaded."
  ],
  "plugins": ["@stryker-mutator/vitest-runner", "@stryker-mutator/typescript-checker"],
  "testRunner": "vitest",
  "testRunnerNodeArgs": [],
  "vitest": {
    "configFile": "vitest.stryker.config.ts"
  },
  "reporters": ["progress", "clear-text", "html", "json"],
  "htmlReporter": {
    "fileName": "reports/mutation/index.html"
  },
  "coverageAnalysis": "perTest",
  "_comment_mutate_second_half": [
    "Everything from `src/shared/favicons` onwards was added in one pass, after the features built",
    "alongside the scaffold were wired up. Added deliberately and by name for the reason above: a",
    "module left out keeps the overall score healthy while saying nothing at all about it.",
    "",
    "The entries live in `mutate` itself and not as comments inside that array \u2014 a comment string there",
    "is read as a glob, and a glob that matches nothing is exactly the silent kind of wrong this",
    "project spends its comments avoiding."
  ],
  "_comment_mutate": [
    "An allowlist, not a glob over src: every entry is pure logic that unit tests can",
    "reach. A new pure module has to be added here deliberately — an omission is",
    "invisible, because the overall score stays healthy while saying nothing about the",
    "code that was left out."
  ],
  "mutate": [
    "src/shared/url/**/*.ts",
    "src/shared/split/**/*.ts",
    "src/shared/ui/anchor.ts",
    "src/shared/split/dropzones.ts",
    "src/shared/split/tile-fill.ts",
    "src/shared/split/tile-bar.ts",
    "src/shared/split/tile-header.ts",
    "src/shared/filters/**/*.ts",
    "src/shared/product.ts",
    "src/shared/overlay/surface.ts",
    "src/shared/quicklinks/model.ts",
    "src/shared/shortcuts/bindings.ts",
    "src/shared/shortcuts/format.ts",
    "src/shared/extensions/model.ts",
    "src/main/privacy/RequestPipeline.ts",
    "src/main/privacy/FilterEngine.ts",
    "src/main/crypto/**/*.ts",
    "src/main/passwords/**/*.ts",
    "src/shared/passwords/**/*.ts",
    "src/main/data/HistoryStore.ts",
    "src/shared/history/model.ts",
    "src/main/session/headers.ts",
    "src/main/session/permission-policy.ts",
    "src/main/ipc/sender-policy.ts",
    "src/main/ipc/router.ts",
    "src/main/browser/SplitController.ts",
    "src/main/settings/describe.ts",
    "src/main/browser/TabDragController.ts",
    "src/main/browser/TileOccupancyController.ts",
    "src/main/browser/TileFullscreenController.ts",
    "src/main/data/ExtensionStore.ts",
    "src/main/data/atomic-write.ts",
    "src/main/data/store-load.ts",
    "src/main/data/quarantine.ts",
    "src/main/data/JsonStore.ts",

    "src/shared/favicons/model.ts",
    "src/shared/thumbnails/model.ts",
    "src/shared/tabgroups/model.ts",
    "src/shared/tabgroups/palette.ts",
    "src/shared/tabgroups/strip.ts",
    "src/shared/strip/**/*.ts",
    "src/shared/tabgroups/schema.ts",
    "src/shared/history/presentation.ts",
    "src/shared/quicklinks/cards.ts",
    "src/main/data/FaviconStore.ts",
    "src/main/data/ThumbnailStore.ts",
    "src/main/data/TabGroupStore.ts",
    "src/main/data/UserRuleStore.ts",
    "src/main/data/PermissionStore.ts",
    "src/main/permissions/model.ts",
    "src/main/permissions/PermissionArbiter.ts",
    "src/main/privacy/FilterSubscription.ts",
    "src/main/privacy/PublicSuffixSubscription.ts",
    "src/main/privacy/FilterListStore.ts",
    "src/main/browser/TabGroupController.ts",
    "src/main/browser/window-options.ts",
    "src/shared/session/model.ts",
    "src/shared/session/restore.ts",
    "src/shared/session/tab-ids.ts",
    "src/main/data/SessionStore.ts",
    "src/main/session-restore/apply.ts",
    "src/main/menu/tab-context-items.ts",
    "src/main/menu/arrangement-items.ts",
    "src/main/menu/page-context-items.ts",
    "src/main/menu/blocker-menu-items.ts",
    "src/main/menu/site-menu-items.ts",
    "src/shared/site/model.ts",
    "src/main/menu/alternative-accelerators.ts",
    "src/main/menu/tab-position-accelerators.ts",
    "src/main/menu/menu-text.ts",
    "src/main/browser/page-keys.ts",
    "src/main/browser/navigation-policy.ts",
    "src/main/browser/sender-window.ts",
    "src/main/browser/tab-strip-position.ts",
    "src/main/updates/UpdateService.ts",
    "src/main/updates/update-text.ts",
    "src/main/updates/version.ts",
    "src/shared/gestures/**/*.ts",
    "src/main/startup-flags.ts",
    "src/main/shutdown.ts",
    "src/shared/media/**/*.ts",
    "src/main/media/**/*.ts",
    "src/shared/arrangements/model.ts",
    "src/shared/arrangements/schema.ts",
    "src/main/data/ArrangementStore.ts",
    "src/main/browser/ArrangementController.ts",
    "src/main/browser/unload-guard.ts",
    "src/shared/browser/**/*.ts",
    "src/main/browser/tab-failure-watch.ts",
    "src/shared/data/inventory.ts",
    "src/main/data/clear-data.ts",
    "src/main/data/panic.ts",
    "src/main/backup/format.ts",
    "src/main/backup/create-backup.ts",
    "src/main/backup/stage-restore.ts",
    "src/main/backup/documents.ts",
    "src/main/backup/backup-service.ts",
    "src/shared/backup/**/*.ts",
    "src/main/menu/menu-actions.ts",
    "src/shared/privacy/https-token.ts",
    "src/main/privacy/https-exemptions.ts",
    "src/shared/network/proxy-rules.ts",
    "src/shared/session/unload-policy.ts",
    "src/main/browser/tab-unloader.ts",
    "src/main/browser/permission-tabs.ts",
    "src/shared/search/rank.ts",
    "src/shared/search/tab-search.ts",
    "src/shared/omnibox/**/*.ts",
    "src/main/ipc/omnibox-handlers.ts",
    "src/shared/import/**/*.ts",
    "src/main/import/**/*.ts",
    "src/main/ipc/import-handlers.ts",
    "src/shared/workspaces/**/*.ts",
    "src/main/data/WorkspaceStore.ts",
    "src/main/ipc/workspace-handlers.ts",
    "!**/*.d.ts"
  ],
  "checkers": ["typescript"],
  "tsconfigFile": "tsconfig.node.json",
  "ignoreStatic": true,
  "thresholds": {
    "high": 90,
    "low": 80,
    "break": 70
  },
  "timeoutMS": 20000,
  "concurrency": 4,
  "tempDirName": ".stryker-tmp",
  "cleanTempDir": true,
  "jsonReporter": {
    "fileName": "reports/mutation/mutation.json"
  }
}
